    <string name="howto_title_slide">How to play: Sliding puzzle</string>
    <string name="howto_slide_1">Slide the tiles until the numbers are in order, 1 at the top left, the empty space last.</string>
    <string name="howto_slide_2">Tap a tile in the same row or column as the empty space: it slides into the space, and the tiles between them move along with it. That is one move.</string>
