    <string name="howto_title_target">How to play: Target number</string>
    <string name="howto_target_1">Reach the target number using the four numbers you are given. You do not have to use all of them.</string>
    <string name="howto_target_2">Tap a number, then an operation (+, −, ×, ÷), then another number. The two numbers are replaced by the result, and the result can be used again.</string>
    <string name="howto_target_3">Every number can be used only once. Results must be whole numbers above zero: a subtraction can not reach zero or go below, and a division must come out even. Numbers that do not fit are dimmed.</string>
    <string name="howto_target_4">There is no losing. If you get stuck, take back the last operation or start again. Your moves keep counting. The faster the better.</string>
    <string name="howto_target_5">Every target can be reached. The number next to the moves is the fewest operations it takes.</string>
